'''Executioner's Presence''' is a [[monster aura]] [[debuff]], granted by the monster mod {{c|mod|[[Modifier:MonsterModPreventRecoveryAura|of the Executioner]]}}, which is displayed in the monster nameplate as: {{c|normal|Prevents Recovery above 50%}}. It prevents recovery to above 50% [[life]] or [[energy shield]] while inside the aura radius.

==Version history==
{{Version history table header}}
{{Version history table row|3.26.0|
* The Executioner Monster modifier's Aura once again does not prevent minions from recovering life.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.20.0|
* Monster mods now only do one specific thing.
* {{c|mod|[[Modifier:MonsterArchnemesisExecutioner|Executioner]]}} is removed from the monster mod pool
** The new mod no longer grants immune to [[Culling strike|Culling Strike]] and 15% (increase or more?) damage with hits per 10% missing enemy life.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.18.0|
* [[Archnemesis modifiers]] are added to the core game.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.17.0|
* Introduced to the game as part of [[Archnemesis league]].
}}
{{Version history table end}}

